          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana bakwa-Israyeli abazange bawahlule, ngokuba izikhulu zenhlangano zazifunge uJehova uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli. Ibandla lonke lakhonona ngezikhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.18",
