          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamphendula uJoshuwa, bathi: “Ngokuba zatshelwa nokutshelwa ezincekwini zakho ukuthi uJehova uNkulunkulu wakho wayala inceku yakhe uMose ukuba aninike izwe lonke, abhubhise bonke abakhileyo ezweni phambi kwenu, ngalokho sahlupheka kakhulu, sesaba kakhulu. Ukuphila kwethu ngenxa yenu, futhi senza le nto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
